{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/27/photo_5.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメント有難う御座います＋＋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忙しい中、私の為に 皆さんは\nコメントを書いてくれてるんだなあ\nと思うと嬉しくて、\n夜中でも更新してしまう私です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も寒かったですね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は１日中くっつき虫になって、\nメンバーにひっついてました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に寒いのが苦手です（ ;  ; ）（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今、あわ あわ の お風呂に\n入ったので、ぽか ぽ か です○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後のひなちゃんから\n誕生日に貰ったバス バブル 、\n勿体無いからちょっとずつだけど\n大事に使ってるんです。(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんのぽかぽかになる方法は\nなんですか？◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬生まれのくせに、寒がりな私に\n教えてください (>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで、風邪の季節ですので\n身体には気をつけて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な週末を\n過ごしてくださいっ＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も いい日になりますように…＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お休みなさいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/27/image.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/27/photo_4.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっぴんごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"}